---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Coopers Grass Fed Beef"
  description="How Coopers Grass Fed Beef collects, uses, and protects your information when you order online or visit coopersgrassfedbeef.com."
>
  <section class="bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
      <nav class="text-[13px] text-ink/50 mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-pasture transition">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span>Privacy</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold mb-3">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3rem)] tracking-tight text-ink leading-[1.1]">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-ink/60">
        Effective November 15, 2026 &middot; All dates and deadlines are in
        <strong>Central Time (CT)</strong>, our local time in Amarillo, TX.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 text-[15px] text-ink/80 leading-relaxed space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">What this policy covers</h2>
          <p>
            This policy explains what information Coopers Grass Fed Beef
            ("we", "us") collects when you visit coopersgrassfedbeef.com or
            place an order, how we use it, and the choices you have.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">What we collect</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 marker:text-pasture">
            <li>
              <strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you submit the order
              form or contact us, we collect your name, email, phone number,
              shipping address, share size, cut preferences, and preferred
              payment method.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Payment information.</strong> Card payments are processed
              by <strong>Stripe</strong>. Card numbers are entered on Stripe's
              own page — we never see or store full card details. We only see
              the last 4 digits, card brand, and payment status.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Automatic information.</strong> Like most websites, we
              collect basic analytics (pages viewed, approximate location,
              device type, referring site) through
              <strong>Google Analytics</strong> and
              <strong>Google Ads</strong> tags so we can measure traffic and
              improve the site.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">How we use it</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 marker:text-pasture">
            <li>Confirm and fulfill your order (cut sheet, processing, shipping, payment).</li>
            <li>Send order updates, ready notices, balance reminders, and tracking.</li>
            <li>Respond to questions, returns, or refund requests.</li>
            <li>Measure site performance and advertising results.</li>
            <li>Meet legal, tax, and accounting obligations.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information. We do not share
            your contact details with other businesses for their marketing.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">Who we share it with</h2>
          <p>We share information only with the service providers we need to run the business:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-3 marker:text-pasture">
            <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — card payment processing.</li>
            <li><strong>Formspree</strong> — delivery of your order form to our inbox.</li>
            <li><strong>Google</strong> (Analytics, Ads, Workspace) — site measurement and email.</li>
            <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — website hosting and security.</li>
            <li><strong>Shipping carriers</strong> — to deliver your order.</li>
            <li><strong>Our processor</strong> — to cut and pack your share.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We may also share information when required by law, or to protect
            our rights, safety, or property.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">How long we keep it</h2>
          <p>
            We keep order records as long as needed to provide the product,
            handle any refund or warranty claim, and meet tax or legal
            requirements — typically up to <strong>7 years (Central Time)</strong>.
            Analytics data is kept per Google's default retention settings.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">Cookies &amp; tracking</h2>
          <p>
            Our site uses cookies and similar technologies for site
            functionality and analytics (Google Analytics, Google Ads). You can
            block or delete cookies in your browser settings; some site
            features may not work if you do. You can opt out of Google
            Analytics by installing Google's
            <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-pasture font-semibold hover:underline">Analytics Opt-out add-on</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">Your choices</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 marker:text-pasture">
            <li>
              <strong>Access, correct, or delete</strong> the information we hold
              about you — email us and we'll handle it within 30 days (Central Time).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Stop order emails</strong> at any time by replying "stop"
              or asking us by phone.
            </li>
            <li>
              If you are in California or another state with privacy rights
              (CCPA/CPRA, etc.), you may have additional rights. Email us to
              exercise them.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">Children</h2>
          <p>
            Our site is not directed to children under 13 and we do not
            knowingly collect their information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">Security</h2>
          <p>
            We use reputable providers (Stripe, Google, Cloudflare, Formspree)
            and reasonable safeguards to protect your information. No system
            is 100% secure — if we ever learn of a breach that affects you,
            we'll notify you as required by law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">Changes</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy. The version posted on
            coopersgrassfedbeef.com with the latest effective date is the one
            that applies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Privacy questions or requests? Reach us at
            <a href="tel:2542189863" class="text-pasture font-semibold hover:underline">(254) 218-9863</a>
            or
            <a href="mailto:Coopersgrassfedbeef@gmail.com" class="text-pasture font-semibold hover:underline">Coopersgrassfedbeef@gmail.com</a>.
            Mail: Coopers Grass Fed Beef, 3201 Barry Dean Dr, Amarillo, TX.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-block bg-pasture text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-pasture/90 transition"
        >
          Back to Home
        </a>
        <a
          href="/terms"
          class="inline-block bg-transparent text-pasture border border-pasture/30 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-pasture/5 transition"
        >
          Terms of Service
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
